::  c4: nested wet fires from one subject (wet.rs fire_wet_rib_contains). The
::  door's arms call each other, so each inner fire comes from the same
::  redone door as a rib entry: same dox with another arm (h after g), and
::  another core's dox (z.e).
|%
++  d
  =/  e  |@  ++  z  1  --
  |@
  ++  f  g
  ++  g  [h z.e]
  ++  h  1
  --
++  main  f:d
--
